creases serotonin and calms the mind\n2. helps expel damaging toxins\n3. lowers heart and respiratory rates\n4. lowers blood pressure\n5. enhances mood\n\nChoose any one of five state settings:\n1. Happiness\n2. Calm\n3. Focus\n4. Energize\n5. Core breathing\n\nIt was researched and created by a clinical hypnotherapist and mindfulness coach to bring you a quick and efficient method to shift into a state of balance, flow, health and focus with ease.\n\nChoose your path and be on your way to deeper breathing effortlessly. Like sitting in a hot tub with mineral spring water and soaking in whole body wellness inside and out.", "short_description": "Flow for Breath VR will help center your thoughts and calm your mind."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.CoreReboot.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.CoreReboot.com/", "publisher_name": "CoreReboot ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.CoreReboot.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["CASUAL", "EDUCATIONAL", "PRODUCTIVITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "613414459717589"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162771_1662887517339930_6434635039824150528_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kQPlf0tuA4oQ7kNvwGrRr3A&_nc_oc=Adnwk73OwqgHdKGH2G3IipGXilEPhjXKFMVNMxkqvcbeJVrwL4DweAs3m30zEbpGT08&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftFP2Apk5pauAk5KHIlY1RSEZiSbNhC4emOoHgVENRYrA&